      "quote": "- Return exactly five keys: `total_orders`, `matched_count`, `refund_total`, `net_total`, and `unmatched_ids`."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6-L3",
      "quote": "- `total_orders` is the number of result records in `matches`."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6-L4",
      "quote": "- `matched_count` counts only results whose status is exactly lowercase `matched`."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6-L5",
      "quote": "- `refund_total` is the supplied positive refund total in integer cents."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6-L6",
      "quote": "- `net_total = matched payment amounts − refund_total`, with a lower bound of zero;"
